Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.98,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,If you placed Mount Everest at the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.03,0:00:05.28,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,bottom of the Mariana Trench,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.33,0:00:08.31,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,its highest peak would still be submerged
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:11.60,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,under more than two kilometers of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.65,0:00:13.18,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Welcome to CurioSphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.23,0:00:16.34,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Today, we descend into the deepest geological
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.39,0:00:17.92,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,fracture on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.97,0:00:20.66,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,As you leave the sunlit surface,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.71,0:00:23.94,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,light disappears entirely within two hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.99,0:00:26.25,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,At eleven thousand meters down,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:29.54,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,the water pressure exceeds one thousand atmospheres.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:32.57,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,That is equivalent to having the weight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:35.60,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,of fifty jumbo jets pressing against your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.65,0:00:36.65,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.70,0:00:39.64,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Yet, life thrives in the abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.69,0:00:42.67,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Specialized organisms produce piezolytes to prevent their
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.72,0:00:44.67,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,cellular membranes from solidifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.72,0:00:47.71,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,We have mapped more of Mars than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.76,0:00:48.50,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,our own ocean trenches.
